  "text": "Calendars sync directly with Google and Microsoft. Two-way, in real-time. Tours, meetings, venue events, blocked dates, staff availability. And when VenueBot books a tour, it appears instantly where your team already works. No double entry, no diary clashes, no manual updates. Every venue has its own sales process, so every venue gets its own pipeline. First enquiry, information sent, tour booked, tour completed, proposal sent, booking confirmed. Move a couple from one stage to another and the entire system updates around them. Automations, tasks, communications, follow-up, all adjusted automatically. Automations handle the repetitive work that consumes hours every week. Enquiry responses, brochure delivery, tour confirmations, follow-up reminders, thank you messages, database reactivation campaigns. Even personalised agreements and terms can be generated and sent automatically. Built once, running every day, without anyone touching them.",
